      "id": "aHR0cHM6Ly90b3VjaGNhc3QuY29tL2Fib3V0",
      "title": "About Us",
      "location": null,
      "url": "https://touchcast.com/about",
      "description": "About Touchcast | Pioneering the Generative Web with GenAI Join us for a special launch of Touchcast Mentor @ Microsoft Ignite → TOUCHCAST'S NEW AI METAMODEL SURPASSES GPT-4O WITH LEVEL 2 AI → Touchcast delivers world’s fastest AI by integrating Groq with CogCache → Touchcast and Microsoft join forces in game-changing GenAI collaboration → Platform Genything Easily Create Immersive, Generative Experiences Ciscape Transform Your Website Into A Conversational Experience CogCache Accelerate, Align And Safeguard Your LLM Operations Solutions Financial Services Automotive E-Commerce Learning & Development Public Services Resources Blog Security GDPR Report Unethical Behavior Media Kit Help Center Company About Us Customers Careers Press take a platform tour Get Started Platform Genything Easily Create Immersive, Generative Experiences Ciscape Transform Your Website Into A Conversational Experience CogCache Accelerate, Align And SafeguardYour LLM Operations Solutions Financial Services Automotive E-Commerce Learning & Development Public Service Resources Blog Security GDPR Report Unethical Behavior Media Kit Help Center Company About Us Customers Careers Press Pioneering the Generative Web The world's leading organizations are looking to unleash the potential of Generative AI. But navigating the complex landscape of GenAI can be daunting. That’s where Touchcast comes in We empower organizations to unlock the limitless potential of Generative AI, allowing effortless engagement with immersive, multimodal experiences. Our robust GenAI stack delivers end-to-end capabilities - from content creation to publishing to safe, optimized distribution. Whether you aim to revolutionize customer engagement, elevate employee learning and development or transform corporate communications, Touchcast makes it simple for anyone to unleash the boundless capabilities of Generative AI in a secure, responsible way. Meet the team We’re an award-winning group of passionate inventors, storytellers, developers, designers and producers who thrive on challenging the status quo in pursuit of our mission to improve people’s lives through the power of generative experiences. Gorgeous virtual sets Transport your speakers into gorgeous virtual spaces that elevate your brand and create an immersive experience. AI-powered articles Automatically turn every session into a searchable, interactive article. Accessible in every language Real-time captions, foreign subtitles and dubbing for every session. Pro production White-glove service to plan, manage and produce your event, with playbooks, contingency planning and daily project plans. Real-time event insights Detailed, real-time analytics covering the entire lifecycle of your event. Built for engagement Meeting suites, chat, real-time Q&A, polls and quizzes. “Touchcast is the Tesla of Virtual Events” Tom Lounibos Global Managing Director - Accenture Ventures Proven, experienced leadership. Edo Segal CEO, Co-Founder Michael Kohlmeyer H. CSO, Co-Founder Ziv Navoth CRO Yoram Bibring CFO Amir Avitzur COO Faith Gabriel-Svaboe Head of People Alyson Schwartz General Counsel Proven, experienced leadership Edo Segal CEO, Co-Founder Edo Segal CEO, Co-Founder Edo Segal CEO, Co-Founder Linkedin For the past 20 years, Edo Segal has pioneered the intersection of artificial intelligence and communications. After founding and successfully exiting several companies within the search domain, he founded Touchcast in 2012. Touchcast is leading the “Generative Web” revolution by providing a turnkey, full-stack solution to for creating, publishing and distributing conversational, multimodal generative experiences, transforming how companies communicate, educate, support and sell. Michael Kohlmeyer-Hyman Co-Founder Michael Kohlmeyer-Hyman Co-Founder Michael Kohlmeyer-Hyman Co-Founder Linkedin Michael Kohlmeyer-Hyman co-founded Touchcast alongside CEO Edo Segal in 2012. He evangelizes video as an unparalleled medium for communicating information, building trust, and bringing people closer together. Prior to Touchcast, Michael served as Executive Vice President of Business Affairs of bMuse, an innovation platform focusing on consumer media startups, which he also co-founded with Edo in 2007. Earlier in his career, he worked as Senior Vice President and General Counsel for Fundtech, a leading banking-solutions provider of software products and services to multi-sized banks around the world. During his five-year tenure, Michael advised the company’s CEO and Board of Directors, while leading M&A and serving on the strategy committee. He earned a JD from Boston University School of Law, as well as a BA degree in history from University of Michigan. Ziv Navoth CMO Ziv Navoth CMO Ziv Navoth CMO Linkedin An industry thought leader in digital publishing, innovation, entrepreneurship, and new-product development, Ziv Navoth is Chief Revenue Officer at Touchcast, which he joined in 2020 and is based in New York City. Prior to Touchcast, Ziv founded Paragraph in 2010 and served as its CEO for over a decade, with a mission to reimagine publishing by helping people discover, tell, and experience great stories. An accomplished author, he published his first book, Nanotales , in 2007. Earlier in his career, Ziv was Senior Vice President of Marketing & Partnerships for Aol's social media and communications businesses, which he joined through its $850 million acquisition of Bebo (2008), where he was Vice President of Marketing & Business Development and part of its executive team that led the negotiations and eventual sale of the company. Prior to Bebo, Ziv built and ran EMEA marketing for Decru, a storage-security company (acquired by NetApp, 2005). A serial entrepreneur, Ziv also founded Verve! (2001), a boutique management consultancy, as well as Startup Station Plc (1999), a private-equity firm. Ziv holds an MBA in Innovation, Strategy, Information & Technology from the Theseus International Management Institute/EDHEC",
